(LEGAL-013 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: G.O. \(Ms\) No. 50, Industries \(MMC.1\) & PWD  Free Removal of Tank Silt \(Sav) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: District Collector, Tahsildar & Assistant Engineer \(WRD\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Rule 12\(2-A\) Tamil Nadu Minor Mineral Concession Rules) Tj T*
(Permits farmers and potters to excavate silt/vandal from notified PWD/WRD and) Tj T*
(Rural Development irrigation tanks free of seigniorage fee for agricultural soil) Tj T*
(enrichment, restoring lost storage capacity of silted tanks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Condition 4 & Condition 7 \(Depth Limit & Bund Safety Buffer\)) Tj T*
(Excavation depth shall never exceed 1.5 meters below the sill level of the lowest) Tj T*
(sluice, and a strict 30-meter no-dig safety buffer must be maintained from the toe) Tj T*
(of the tank bund and masonry structures; commercial sale of excavated earth is) Tj T*
(strictly prohibited.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
